SUMMARY:The Cabaret Burlesque presents: Code Red
LOCATION:Berlin\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:TCB presents: CODE RED Industry Night Weekly on Monday Doors 8p
 
m Guest Opening Acts 8pm Main Show featuring The Cabaret Burlesque 9-10:30 
 
Music and Bar until 12 am Contact @thecabaretburlesque on instagram to APPL
 
Y to perform as an Opening Act An Industry Night where your wildest fantasi
 
es just might come true. Welcome to CODE RED---an electrifying world where 
 
Parisian cabaret meets Amsterdam's edge\, Moscow's mystique\, and the unapo
 
logetic glamour of Studio 54. Fashion is as much a part of the performance 
 
as the artists themselves\, with striking couture\, bold silhouettes\, and 
 
runway-worthy style setting the scene for an unforgettable night. Expect da
 
zzling performances\, intoxicating music\, provocative artistry\, and immer
 
sive moments that blur the line between audience and spectacle. Inspired by
 
 the golden age of nightlife\, where icons\, artists\, and dreamers came to
 
 see and be seen\, CODE RED celebrates fearless self-expression\, decadent 
 
entertainment\, and the thrill of the unexpected. Dress boldly. Stay curiou
 
s. Bring your calling card. Welcome to the show where fantasy\, fashion\, a
 
nd nightlife collide. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/the-c
 
abaret-burlesque-presents-code-berlin-tickets/15052633
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/the-cabaret-burlesque-presents-code-ber
 
lin-tickets/15052633
